# ASSISTANT

Now I see the issue clearly. The tests that modify files (like `test_replace_function_basic`) are running in parallel with tests that depend on specific line positions (like `test_calls_outgoing` which expects `createSampleUser` at line 6).

The solution is to make tests that modify files use their own **isolated copy** of the fixture files. Let me look at other test files to see the full pattern:

